      "text": [
        "118 - وعن أبي جعفر عليه السلام: من قضى لمسلم حاجته ناداه الله عز وجل: ثوابك علي، ولا أرضى لك ثوابا دون الجنة."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.muhajir-b-ali": [
          "118. It has been reported that Abu Ja'far (a.s) said: One who fulfils the need of a Muslim will be called out to by Allah [M.G] saying, 'your reward is upon Me and I shall not be satisfied with a reward for you less than Paradise."
        ]
      }
